<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Relieving Order - Kaushal Darpan</title>
<style>
    :root {
        --primary-color: #1a237e;
        --secondary-color: #f5f5f5;
        --border-color: #333;
    }

 

    /* Screen Styles */
    body {
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        font-size: 12px; /* Slightly smaller font to ensure fit */
        background-color: #e0e0e0;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 20px 0;
        color: #222;
    }

    .no-print-btn {
        display: block;
        margin: 0 auto 10px auto;
        padding: 8px 20px;
        background-color: var(--primary-color);
        color: white;
        border-radius: 4px;
        cursor: pointer;
        font-weight: bold;
    }

    .page {
        width: 210mm; /* A4 Width */
        min-height: 297mm; /* A4 Height */
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 15mm; 
        background: #fff;
        box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        position: relative;
        box-sizing: border-box; /* Crucial for including padding in width */
    }

    /* Watermark */
    .page::before {
        content: "KAUSHAL DARPAN";
        position: absolute;
        top: 50%;
        left: 50%;
        transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-45deg);
        font-size: 70px;
        color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
        white-space: nowrap;
        pointer-events: none;
        z-index: 0;
    }

    table {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        table-layout: fixed; /* Prevents tables from pushing past margins */
        margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .main-table td {
        border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        padding: 6px 8px; /* Reduced padding to save space */
        word-wrap: break-word; /* Prevents long text from breaking layout */
    }

    /* Header & Titles */
    .header-title {
        font-size: 18px;
        font-weight: bold;
        text-align: center;
        color: var(--primary-color);
    }

    .order-title {
        font-size: 16px;
        font-weight: bold;
        text-align: center;
        background-color: var(--secondary-color);
        padding: 8px !important;
    }

    .label-cell {
        background-color: #f9f9f9;
        width: 25%;
        font-weight: 600;
    }

    .data-cell { font-weight: bold; }

    .signature-block {
        margin-top: 30px;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .footer {
        position: absolute;
        bottom: 15mm;
        left: 15mm;
        right: 15mm;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 10px;
        border-top: 1px solid #ddd;
        padding-top: 5px;
    }
</style>
</head>

<body>

    <button class="no-print-btn" onclick="window.print()">Print Order</button>

    <div class='page'>
        <div class="page-border">
            <table class='main-table'>
                <tr>
                    <td style='width:20%; text-align:center;'>
                        <div style="color: var(--primary-color); line-height: 1.2;">
                            <b style="font-size: 18px;">कौशल<br />दर्पण</b><br />
                            <small>Kaushal Darpan</small>
                        </div>
                    </td>
                    <td style='width:60%;'>
                        <div class='header-title'>तकनीकी शिक्षा विभाग, राजस्थान</div>
                        <div class='school-name'>GOVT. ITI JAIPUR</div>
                        <div class='center' style="font-size: 12px;">Village: Jaipur, Block: Sanganer, District: Jaipur</div>
                    </td>
                    <td style='width:20%; text-align:center; height: 100px;'>
                        <div style="border: 1px dashed #ccc; height: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #aaa; font-size: 10px;">
                            Passport Size<br />Photo
                        </div>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td colspan='3' class='order-title'>कार्यमुक्ति आदेश (RELIEVING ORDER)</td>
                </tr>
            </table>

            <table class='main-table'>
                <tr>
                    <td class="label-cell">आदेश क्रमांक (ID)</td>
                    <td class="data-cell">123456</td>
                    <td class="label-cell">जारी दिनांक</td>
                    <td class="data-cell">12-01-2026</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="label-cell">कार्मिक का नाम</td>
                    <td colspan='3' class="data-cell" style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--primary-color);">ANIL KUMAR</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="label-cell">एम्प्लाई आईडी (ID)</td>
                    <td colspan='3' class="data-cell">RJ123456789</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="label-cell">जन्म तिथि / मोबाइल</td>
                    <td class="data-cell">20-06-1990</td>
                    <td colspan="2" class="data-cell">Mob: 9876543210</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="label-cell">पद एवं विषय</td>
                    <td class="data-cell">Instructor</td>
                    <td class="label-cell">विषय</td>
                    <td class="data-cell">Fitter</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="label-cell">रिलीविंग का कारण</td>
                    <td colspan='3' class="data-cell">स्थानांतरण (Transfer)</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="label-cell">प्राधिकरण अधिकारी</td>
                    <td colspan='3' class="data-cell">Director, Technical Education</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="label-cell">मूल आदेश विवरण</td>
                    <td class="data-cell">ORD-001</td>
                    <td class="label-cell">आदेश दिनांक</td>
                    <td class="data-cell">10-01-2026</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="label-cell">नवीन पदस्थापन स्थान</td>
                    <td colspan='3' class="data-cell" style="background-color: #fff9c4;">Govt ITI Jodhpur</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="label-cell">कार्यमुक्ति समय</td>
                    <td class="data-cell">12-01-2026</td>
                    <td colspan="2" class="data-cell">मध्याह्न पूर्व (10:30 AM)</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td colspan='3' class="label-cell">उपभोग किए गए आकस्मिक अवकाश (Current Year CL)</td>
                    <td class="data-cell" style="text-align: center; font-size: 16px;">05</td>
                </tr>
            </table>

            <div class="signature-block">
                <div style="font-size: 12px; line-height: 2;">
                    पत्र प्रेषण क्रमांक: .............................<br />
                    दिनांक: ...........................................
                </div>
                <div style="text-align: center; min-width: 250px;">
                    <br /><br />
                    <b style="font-size: 14px;">(हस्ताक्षर मय सील)</b><br />
                    <span>प्रधानाचार्य / विभागाध्यक्ष</span><br />
                    <small>GOVT. ITI JAIPUR</small>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class='copy-section'>
                <b>प्रतिलिपि सूचनार्थ एवं आवश्यक कार्यवाही हेतु (Copy to):</b><br />
                1. निदेशक, तकनीकी शिक्षा विभाग, राजस्थान सरकार<br />
                2. संबंधित कार्मिक श्री ANIL KUMAR को अनुपालना हेतु<br />
                3. वैयक्तिक पत्रावली / रक्षित पत्रावली
            </div>

            <div class='footer'>
                Generated via <b>Kaushal Darpan Portal</b> | System Date: <span id="printDate"></span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        const now = new Date();
        const options = { day: '2-digit', month: '2-digit', year: 'numeric', hour: '2-digit', minute: '2-digit' };
        document.getElementById('printDate').innerText = now.toLocaleDateString('en-GB', options);
    </script>
</body>
</html>